# Review rules

<!-- Read by the pr-review skill. Keep it short; delete what you do not need. -->

Kind: research

## Tests

Command: `uv run pytest -q`
Not runnable locally: tests marked `gpu` (`uv run pytest -m gpu`; on a cluster only when asked)

## Risk paths

High: `src/{{ project_name_snake }}/`, `configs/`, `scripts/run_*.py`
Medium: `scripts/plot_*.py`
Low: `README.md`, `SPEC.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `tests/`

## Screenshots and numbers

Numbers: <!-- the smallest config that reaches the changed code, e.g. `uv run python scripts/run_<experiment>.py --limit 2` -->
Figures: `uv run python scripts/plot_<experiment>.py`, compare `figs/<experiment>.pdf`

## What counts as a failure here

- Reported numbers change without a stated reason
- A stopped run cannot resume

## Ignore

`data/`, `logs/`, `results/`, `figs/`, `checkpoints/`, `notebooks/` (not in git)

